$ l10n check
error[placeholders] de: "Your order of {total} ships on {day}."
    {total} is missing, so the program's value is never shown
warning[fuzzy] fr: "[cart] {count} item"
    marked fuzzy, a guess gettext does not show until a translator confirms it
warning[fuzzy] fr: "{count} parcel is on its way."
    marked fuzzy, a guess gettext does not show until a translator confirms it
error[plural-forms] pl: "{count} parcel is on its way."
    the form many is empty, so a count that takes it shows the source text
error[markup] pl: "<b>Free</b> delivery on orders over {total}."
    the markup differs: <b> </b> missing
error[plural-forms] ar: "[cart] {count} item"
    the forms zero, two, few, many are empty, so a count that takes them shows the source text
error[links] ja: "Questions? Visit <a href="https://{site}/help">our help pages</a>."
    the link's host "ショップ-.example" is no name DNS can hold: label 1 "ショップ-" of "ショップ-.example" begins or ends with "-" (V3)
